<h2>The scale of India's spice trade</h2>
<p>India exports spices across a wide range of product lines, and the calendar-2024 data we've verified for seven major lines gives a clear picture of where the value actually concentrates. This overview pulls together figures from our individual product pages into one comparison, so you can see the relative scale before drilling into any one spice. Every number below comes from WITS (World Bank) / UN Comtrade export records for 2024, listed under Sources.</p>

